{#
Links for functions to set up and manage the county.
#}

{% set uploadInstructions = path('nlpservices.upload_instructions_form') %}
{% set coordinators = path('nlpservices.coordinators_form') %}
{% set removeCoordinator = path('nlpservices.remove_coordinator_role_form') %}
{% set turfDeliveryMessage = path('nlpservices.turf_delivery_message_form') %}
{% set documents = path('nlpservices.documents_menu') %}
{% set importCountyEarlyVoting = path('nlpservices.import_county_early_voting_form') %}
{% set cancelMoved = path('nlpservices.cancel_moved_report') %}
{% set changeCounty = path('nlpservices.change_county_form') %}
{% set minivanResponseCodes = path('nlpservices.minivan_response_codes') %}

<div class="nlp-menu-page">

{% if county is not empty %}
    <h1>{% trans %}{{ county }} County{% endtrans %}</h1>
{% endif %}

{% if isAdmin %}
    <p>{% trans %}As a site administrator, you can <a href={{ changeCounty }}>change the county to be managed</a>.{% endtrans %}</p>
{% endif %}

    <h1>{% trans %}Set up the site for your county{% endtrans %}</h1>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ uploadInstructions }}>{% trans %}Upload the PDF of the instructions for NLs.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ coordinators }}>{% trans %}Identify the coordinators who provide help to NLs.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ removeCoordinator }}>{% trans %}Remove a coordinator role.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ turfDeliveryMessage }}>{% trans %}Edit the body of the email to deliver a turf to an NL.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
        <li><a href={{ documents }}>{% trans %}Download the manuals for managing NLP.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
{% if stateName == 'Mississippi' %}
        <li><a href={{ importCountyEarlyVoting }}>{% trans %}Upload early voting PDF.{% endtrans %}</a></li>
{% endif %}
    </ul>

    <h1>{% trans %}MiniVAN Setup{% endtrans %}</h1>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ minivanResponseCodes }}>{% trans %}Allowed canvass response codes{% endtrans %}</a></li>
    </ul>

{% trans %}

    <h1>Correct move status</h1>

    <p>An NL can mark a voter as moved, and this status is reported to VoteBuilder.  Unfortunately, there is
    no API function to correct an erroneous report of moved.   The NL has to ask for help.  First, use the function
    here to remove the status from NLP Services.   Then use VoteBuilder to restore the address in the VoterFile.</p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href={{ cancelMoved }}>Cancel an incorrect report that a voter moved.</a></li>
    </ul>

{% endtrans %}
</div>
